Maintainer: Scrumpper <190908034+Scrumpper@users.noreply.github.com>
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Standards-Version: 4.7.0

Package: h96-kernel-switch
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: systemd, initramfs-tools-core, u-boot-tools
Description: H96 MAX V58 kernel switch with boot guard and rollback
 Copies kernel staged by h96-kernel package into new generation
 directory under /boot/h96ks. Image, uInitrd and board DTB links
 resolve through /boot/h96ks/cur, so one rename switches all three.
 Boot guard falls back to previous generation unless trial boot is
 confirmed. Rollback and prune commands. Package itself writes nothing
 under /boot; only command run by administrator does.
